          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.7.15+1CH.7.16+1CH.7.17+1CH.7.18+1CH.7.19+1CH.7.20+1CH.7.21+1CH.7.22+1CH.7.23+1CH.7.24+1CH.7.25+1CH.7.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Int 7.15-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.3.15+2KI.3.16+2KI.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ilai 3.15-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore nena ng'apeta o suyai apa naatii enkaji o Laitoriani, o nkitotoneta enyena o ilo moti lo suyai, apa naatii atua enkaji o Laitoriani, nebel ilkaldayo aaitaa mbelibelat, nenap ilo suyai aaya Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.45"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ilai 7.45",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.4.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ilai 4.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neya ninche imotioo, o nchempei, o nkuteta e nkima, o ntokitin e nkorropil, o masaa pooki o suyai apa naasishoreki te nkaji e Nkai o motioo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o lbakulini. Ore apa nena tokitin e sahabu neya ilo kitok le rripore anaa sahabu ore ina nara enkosholai neya anaa enkosholai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore tialo nena ng'apeta pokira are, o ilo moti, o nkitotoneta enyena, apa naaitobira Solomon te nkaraki enkaji o Laitoriani, ore enkiroishi eilo suyai pooki nemeimakinoyu te nkiroishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkadoro e ng'ape nabo naa ntemat e nkaina tomon o isiet, ore enchumata enye netii osunyai. Ore enkadoro eina dukuya naa ntemat e nkaina uni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eewaki iltung'ana le Yuda Babilon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neya ilo kitok le rripore Seria olapolosani kitok o Sefania ilo apolosani liare, o lelo arripok le kishomi pokira okuni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore teina anasa neya ilo kitok apa oitasheiki iltung'ana le njore, o ltung'ana imiet lo lkiama lo laiguanani apa ooinepuaki te nkanasa; o laigeroni lo lkitok le njore laa ninye apa oipotuo iltung'ana leina kop, o ltung'ana ntomoni ile loo ltung'ana leina kop apa oonotoki teina anasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Nebusaradan ilo kitok le rripore neya ninche, neyau ninche enetii olaiguanani le Babilon te Ribla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Near olaiguanani le Babilon ninche, near metuata te Ribla, tiatua enkop e Hamat. Neaku eewaki apa Yuda eyararoto aaitung'uaa enkop enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gedalia olbalusui le Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te shumata lelo tung'ana oo telekutua te nkop e Yuda, lelo apa ootung'uayie Nebukadnesa olaiguanani le Babilon, negelu ninye Gedalia olayioni le Ahikan, olayioni le Shafan, aitaa olbalusui. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee ening ilarikok pooki le njore, teina kop naisiaja nchere eitaaki tenebo iltung'ana lenye nchere eitaa olaiguanani le Babilon Gedalia o lbalusui, nepuonu ninche tenebo iltung'ana lenye enetii Gedalia te Mispa, aa taa Ishmael olayioni le Natania, o Yohanan olayioni le Karea, o Seriai olayioni le Tahumet le Netofat, o Yaasania olayioni le Maakat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neinos Gedalia olmumai tialo ninche o ltung'ana lenye, ejo, “Emiureishoyu intae te nkaraki ilkituaak loo lkaldayo. Entobik intae tena kop, nisiaayiayia olaiguanani le Babilon, amu keserianu te intae.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore to lapa liopishana, nelotu Elishama, leilo marei le nkitoo, tenebo iltung'ana lenyena tomon, nerasaki Gedalia near metua, tenebo Ilyahudi o Lkaldayo apa ootii tenebo ninye te Mispa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.43.5+JER.43.6+JER.43.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 43.5-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitoki iltung'ana pooki, ilooti o lkituaak o larikok loo njorin, aadumunye nepuo Misiri, amu keure apa Ilkadayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etalakuaki Yohoiakin te jela",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore to lari le tomoni uni oopishana le yararoto e Yehoiakin olaiguanani le Yuda, to lapa le tomon oare, te nkolong e tikitam oopishana o lapa, nelaaya Efil Merodak, ilo aiguanani le Babilon, teilo ari oitera aitoreisho, Yehoiakin olaiguanani le Yuda metupuku te jela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirorie ninye te supatisho, neisho ninye olorika olus too lorikan loo laiguanak apa ootii tenebo ninye te Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eitayio Yehoiakin lelo kilani lenyena le jela, ore too nkolong'i pooki e nkishui enye neinos ninye endaa te mesa o laiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te retoto enye, eishooki apa ninye eretoto e anaake naishoo olaiguanani, ore ake te nkolong neng'amaa erubata, te nkishui enye pooki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
